<h1>What's new</h1>

<p>This page lists what's changed over the last six months, newest first: what's on the beta channel, then what's on the main app.</p>

<p>We release each new feature and fix to the <a href="/help/beta-channel/">beta channel</a> as soon as it's ready, so every change gets its own version. The main app gets them in batches, once they've settled in on the beta channel.</p>

<div id="whats-new-list">
<noscript><style>#whats-new-beta-status { display: none; }</style></noscript>
<h2>Beta channel</h2>
<div id="whats-new-beta">
<div id="whats-new-beta-status">{% loadingSpinner "Checking the beta channel", true %}</div>
</div>
<h2>Main channel</h2>
<div id="whats-new-main">
{% for month in whatsNew %}
<h3>{{ month.month }}</h3>
<ul>
  {%- for release in month.releases %}{% for change in release.changes %}
  <li>{{ change }} <span class="block text-sm text-muted tabular-nums">{{ release.day }} · {{ release.version }}</span></li>
  {%- endfor %}{% endfor %}
</ul>
{% else %}
<p>Nothing to show yet.</p>
{% endfor %}
</div>
</div>
